n on the road  i've been i've had to go home for little  brief moments to do the show and i did  one crazy thing which was  i went to uh to bob saget and kelly  rizzo's wedding  uh which was last sunday so i guess  that's a week ago  yesterday um and i flew home from where  the hell was i  i flew home from the uk uh  for a day for literally one day a 10  hour flight to l.a  went to the wedding and then flew to  amsterdam  and i was just like i gotta do it like  it doesn't make financial sense  certainly and i missed a couple shows  and whatever else but i was like this is  what life's all about like you don't  want to miss all the cool things that  you can  be part of um but the reason i bring  that up is because  um you know we've had to take advanced  tape a couple shows um  so like the the kyle kashuv show that we  put up a couple days ago we had to tape  you know like 10 days ago  tucker had been taped a little bit  before that janice fiamenko and i was  really concerned  that the quality of the show and the  interviews was going to suffer because  normally i would just try to do a show  and we get it out in a day or two  sometimes that day or we live stream it  but i'm really happy to see that the the  quality has not suffered i think some of  the last  few shows that we've done from coleman  hughes to tucker  uh to these last couple with kyle and  janice and everything else  um i think they've been some of our best  shows the one thing i really do miss and  i  and i appreciate your patience is i  really do miss doing the direct messages  the issue with that of course  is that the direct messages usually are  about something pretty topical and i  need to be home for that we've thought  about doing a couple of them just off my  computer like this  so maybe we'll do a little bit more so i  do uh i do look forward to getting back  to that because that's really where i  can share what i'm thinking with you  guys or maybe we'll just  do some more live streams i'd lo